At Finance with Flow, we believe that finance shouldn’t feel complicated or overwhelming.

Our mission is to empower individuals and businesses to navigate the complex world of finance with confidence and ease.

With a blend of expertise, enthusiasm, and a touch of creativity, we’re here to transform financial jargon into opportunities for growth. Get to know the faces behind the solutions, and let’s embark on this journey towards prosperity together.

By outsourcing your finance department to us, you don’t just get number-crunchers—you get a dedicated team of specialists who work together seamlessly to keep your business running smoothly while you get back to doing what you do best.

Within this blog, Finance with Flow would like to introduce you to the people working their magic behind the scenes of Finance with Flow:

### **Roz – Founder & Managing Director**

Roz is the visionary behind Finance with Flow. With over 20 years’ experience in finance and leadership and Top 10 Practice trained, Roz founded the company to provide businesses with a flexible, professional, and approachable finance function.

Her significant industry experience across Start-ups, Turnaround, Owner Managed and Private Equity, allows Roz to parachute into organisations and work across all levels.

Roz oversees strategy, ensures client relationships thrive, and keeps the team aligned with our values: clarity, efficiency, and trust.

### **Nasser – Management & Systems Accountant**

Nasser plays a pivotal role for Finance with Flow and ensures that our financial gears run seamlessly.

With over ten years of experience working in various finance roles, and being ACCA-qualified, Nasser is a self-confessed Excel geek and loves automation and streamlining processes.

Nasser supports our clients by providing guidance and helps them really understand their numbers, to keep them doing what they do best.

With a wealth of experience managing various teams over the years, Nasser’s experience ensures that he always strived to make a difference!

### **Fi – Management Accountant**

Fi’s role at Finance with Flow allows her to really get to know our clients and become part of their team by supporting with the day today running of the finance department, building relationships with clients team members at all levels. This allows Fi to develop a well-rounded picture of performance meaning suggestions of improvement and support any changes going forward can be provided.

Fi achieved her AAT qualification and is continuing her studies to become is a CIMA finalist.

### **Jackie – Bookkeeper**

Jackie is the guardian of our financial records, maintaining order and compliance with an eagle eye. With a passion for precision and a background rooted in underwriting for a Lloyds syndicate, she brings deep expertise and a meticulous approach to everything she does.

As our trusted Bookkeeper, Jackie ensures your numbers always add up—from balancing budgets to maintaining immaculate records. Her dedication to data accuracy means our clients can rely on a rock-solid financial foundation.

But it’s not just about the numbers. Jackie’s approachable and friendly nature makes her a favourite with our clients. She builds strong relationships and is always on hand to support with clarity and care.

### **Jo – Tax Manager**

Jo keeps businesses compliant and stress-free when it comes to tax. From corporation tax planning to VAT and everything in between, she ensures clients meet their obligations while also finding opportunities to be tax-efficient.

With Jo on the team, clients can focus on growth without worrying about HMRC.

### **Why Work With Finance with Flow?**

Outsourcing your finance department means you gain access to a whole team of specialists without the overheads of hiring in-house. At Finance with Flow, we cover every aspect of your financial needs—from bookkeeping and systems setup to tax compliance and management reporting—so you can focus on running and growing your business.

Our team works collaboratively to give you peace of mind, clarity, and confidence in your finances. With Finance with Flow, your numbers don’t just “add up”, they tell the story of your business and help you plan for the future.

